Description: Summarize and visualize ancestral recombination graphs. 'ARGHelpR' uses bed files output from ancestral recombination graph estimation programs to calculate various statistics that can be used to identify different forms of natural selection. 
URL: https://kfarleigh.github.io/ARGHelpR/
